  "reviewed_chain": [
    "Independent current CCountryCreation RTTI identifies parser subobject+0x228; ai_will_do0x29df selects interface+0xb8 and trigger base+0xb0, with country tag5. Current CCountryFormation RTTI parser+0x3d0 selects interface+0xa8 and trigger base+0xa0 with the same country tag.",
    "Current typed creation and formation database RTTI vtables are installed in their registration routines. Those routines place their database pointers through getters0x1407cdcf0 and0x1407cde70 respectively, the exact getters used by the actual AI consumers.",
    "The current loaders construct CCountryCreation/CCountryFormation objects and append them to database+0x80. The creation index builder0x141737ed0 enumerates these definition pointers and populates cultural indexes; gather0x141737af0 reads those indexes into the actual creation candidate list. Formation AI iterates the typed database array directly.",
    "Creation AI0x1415cf250 and formation AI0x1415ceed0 resolve checked CCountry from the AI owner, construct country tag5 plus actor ID+0x18, and evaluate exact trigger members+0xb0/+0xa0 at0x1415cf47b/0x1415cf06d. False branches0x1415cf56f/0x1415cf15a skip current candidates to0x1415cf659/0x1415cf204.",
    "Successful eligibility continues to native command preparation; this proof does not establish future target country, saved scopes or successful creation/formation."
